    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらはい、
ここは萬屋</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welkies. This
is the Yorozu-ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>「よろず」があるから萬屋</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can make whatever you
need yours, at the your-ozu-ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271312</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見てってね～
よかったら買ってって～♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Take a good look~ And if there's
anything you like, please buy it~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私の娘がヴァルハラにいます。
仲間の報告では、ヴァルハラは
瘴気から助かっているようです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My daughter lives in Valhalla.
Our comrades have reported
it's safe from the miasma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>しかし、それもいつまで無事か、
わかりません。この里のように
結界もありませんから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, there's no telling
for how long. They don't have
a barrier, like our village does.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラにいる娘のことが
心配です</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm worried for
my daughter.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつか、あの子には
私の跡を継いで……
いえ……なんでも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I want her to follow in
my footsteps someday,
and... No... It's nothing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は掟を破り、里を抜けて
外の人間と恋に落ちました。
彼との間に女の子がひとりいます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I broke the code, left the village,
and fell in love with an outsider.
We had a single girl together.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>掟と感情の板ばさみになり、
苦悩し続けた末、夫と子を捨て
里へ戻ってきました</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Trapped between my feelings and the
code, I fretted endlessly, then cast off
my husband and child and returned.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>忍者は非情……
しかし親子の情だけは
別ものだと思っています</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ninja are unfeeling. However,
I believe feelings for one's
family are the one exception.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271328</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつか娘だけでもこの里に……
そう思うのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>One day, if even just my daughter
could come here... I think of it often.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラにいる娘のことが
気がかりです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm concerned about
my daughter in Valhalla.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271332</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>３年前に家を出て以来、
一度も会っていません。
大きくなったに違いありません</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I have not seen her since I
left my home, three years ago.
She must have grown since.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>娘も夫も私が忍者であることは
知りません。自分の素性を
隠し通すのが掟ですから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Neither my daughter nor my husband
know I am a ninja. Because hiding
one's identity is part of the code.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>夫はどうして私がいなくなったか、
わからないでいるでしょう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My husband most likely still
wonders why I left them...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仕方ありません、
一族の掟に従ったまでのこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's life. I simply
obeyed the code.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
